cked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2336,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:21:32Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-10-11T08:25:33Z","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:40Z","closed_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:35Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124374","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124374","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124374.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124374.patch","merged_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:35Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n`MaterialStorage::MaterialData::get_default_texture_id()` in the RD renderers has no case for `TYPE_SAMPLEREXT`, so a `samplerExternalOES` uniform with no texture assigned gets an empty RID. `uniform_set_create()` fails on it, and every draw with that material errors and draws nothing:\r\n\r\n```\r\nERROR: Texture (binding: 1) should provide one ID referencing a texture (IDs provided: 0).\r\nERROR: Uniforms were never supplied for set (1) at the time of drawing, which are required by the pipeline.\r\n```\r\n\r\nA `ColorRect` with this shader is enough to see it:\r\n\r\n```glsl\r\nshader_type canvas_item;\r\n\r\nuniform samplerExternalOES external_texture;\r\n\r\nvoid fragment() {\r\n\tCOLOR = texture(external_texture, UV);\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nOn master (Metal, M1) the rect never shows up and the second error repeats every frame. With this PR it draws white, the same as an unassigned `sampler2D`.\r\n\r\nRD already compiles `samplerExternalOES` as `sampler2D`, so the 2D defaults are the right fit and the hints behave as they do for `sampler2D`. \r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nBuilt for Android and macOS and the unit tests pass.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124374/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124374/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}